  <!-- No client-library / no ICompileReferenceContributor: the OTLP receiver is a HOST
       resource owned by the runner (Default ALC, Vouchfx.Engine.Orchestration). This
       provider only reads captured spans through the typed ITraceCaptureAccessor on
       ScriptGlobalVariables.Traces, and its emitted helper needs only BCL types
       (System.Text.Json, System.Collections.Generic) already resolved from the default
       TRUSTED_PLATFORM_ASSEMBLIES set ScenarioRunner.BclReferencePaths() supplies (§5). -->

